{"id":"ru-3a049c5b9532.ru","jokeId":"ru-3a049c5b9532","locale":"ru","adaptation":"original","notes":"Source wording kept; the wife's long line split in two. Four scenes: bedroom (both asleep on the bed, he wakes and walks to the door) → hallway (the drunk with a bottle and a red nose stands in the doorway, the husband comes in) → bedroom again (he lies down, the wife sits up and scolds) → the dark yard, where the drunk is only a voice from the darkness so the swing lands on the last word.","title":"Толкнуть","location":"spalnya","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"needs":[{"kind":"backdrop","id":"night-yard-swing","description":"dark courtyard of an apartment block at night, with a children's swing","why":"the punchline: the drunk wanted a push on the swing in the pitch-dark yard"}],"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Три часа ночи. Муж с женой спят.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Вдруг звонок в дверь.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Муж, матерясь, идет открывать.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"На пороге стоит мужик, очевидно поддатый:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Друг, пойдем со мной, тут рядом, поможешь меня толкануть.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ты, мужик, охренел, что ли? Три часа ночи. Иди кого-нибудь другого проси.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Муж ложится опять в постель.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Жена спрашивает, кто приходил.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Да, какой-то козел застрял, просил его толкнуть. Я его послал.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"zhena","text":"Ты просто зверюга какой-то.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"zhena","text":"Помнишь, как у нас мотор заглох, да под дождем, и нас какой-то парень целый час толкал?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"zhena","text":"Ты что, человека выручить не можешь?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Муж, опять матерясь, вылезает из постели, одевается.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Выходит во двор в полной темноте. Кричит:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Мужик! Ты где?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Из темноты:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Здесь я! Иди сюда!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0,"offscreen":true},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Да где здесь?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Ну здесь, на качелях!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0,"offscreen":true,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"spalnya","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"bed-1"},{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"bed-2"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"sleep"},{"type":"act","who":"zhena","act":"sleep"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"sit"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"door"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"}]},{"location":"gostinaya","place":"front-door","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","muzhik-ryzhy":"drunk"},"looks":{"muzhik-ryzhy":{"add":["red-nose"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"door"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"bottle","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","act":"wave"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"point"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"}]},{"location":"spalnya","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"door"},{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"bed-2"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"bed-1"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"lie"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"act","who":"zhena","act":"shrug"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"wave"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"act","who":"zhena","act":"point"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"act","who":"zhena","act":"shake-head"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"stand"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"door"},{"type":"line","ref":"l13"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","place":"park","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","muzhik-ryzhy":"drunk"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l14"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"wave"},{"type":"line","ref":"l15"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"turn"},{"type":"line","ref":"l16"},{"type":"line","ref":"l17"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"shrug"},{"type":"line","ref":"l18"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"facepalm"},{"type":"line","ref":"l19"}]}]}
{"id":"ru-3a049c5b9532.en","jokeId":"ru-3a049c5b9532","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line; 'give me a push' carries both the stalled car and the swing, as the adapt note says. Same staging as ru: bedroom → hallway with the drunk in the doorway → bedroom → dark yard with the drunk as an offscreen voice.","title":"The Push","location":"spalnya","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"needs":[{"kind":"backdrop","id":"night-yard-swing","description":"dark courtyard of an apartment block at night, with a children's swing","why":"the punchline: the drunk wanted a push on the swing in the pitch-dark yard"}],"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Three in the morning. A husband and wife are asleep.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Suddenly the doorbell rings.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The husband, swearing, goes to open the door.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"On the doorstep stands a man, obviously tipsy:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Buddy, come with me, it's right nearby, you can give me a push.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Man, are you out of your mind? It's three in the morning. Go ask somebody else.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The husband gets back into bed.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"His wife asks who it was.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Oh, some jerk got stuck and asked me to give him a push. I told him to get lost.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"zhena","text":"You're just some kind of beast.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"zhena","text":"Remember when our engine died, in the pouring rain, and some young guy pushed us for a whole hour?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"zhena","text":"Can't you help a person out?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The husband, swearing again, crawls out of bed and gets dressed.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"He goes out into the yard in pitch darkness. He shouts:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Hey, man! Where are you?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Out of the darkness:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Here I am! Over here!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0,"offscreen":true},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Where's here?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Right here, on the swings!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0,"offscreen":true,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"spalnya","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"bed-1"},{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"bed-2"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"sleep"},{"type":"act","who":"zhena","act":"sleep"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"sit"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"door"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"}]},{"location":"gostinaya","place":"front-door","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","muzhik-ryzhy":"drunk"},"looks":{"muzhik-ryzhy":{"add":["red-nose"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"door"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"bottle","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","act":"wave"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"point"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"}]},{"location":"spalnya","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"door"},{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"bed-2"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"bed-1"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"lie"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"act","who":"zhena","act":"shrug"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"wave"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"act","who":"zhena","act":"point"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"act","who":"zhena","act":"shake-head"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"stand"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"door"},{"type":"line","ref":"l13"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","place":"park","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","muzhik-ryzhy":"drunk"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l14"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"wave"},{"type":"line","ref":"l15"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"turn"},{"type":"line","ref":"l16"},{"type":"line","ref":"l17"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"shrug"},{"type":"line","ref":"l18"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"facepalm"},{"type":"line","ref":"l19"}]}]}
{"id":"ru-3a049c5b9532.de","jokeId":"ru-3a049c5b9532","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line; 'anschubsen' works for both the car and the swing (adapt note), the wife's memory of the stalled car uses 'angeschoben'. Same staging as ru.","title":"Anschubsen","location":"spalnya","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"needs":[{"kind":"backdrop","id":"night-yard-swing","description":"dark courtyard of an apartment block at night, with a children's swing","why":"the punchline: the drunk wanted a push on the swing in the pitch-dark yard"}],"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Drei Uhr nachts. Mann und Frau schlafen.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Plötzlich klingelt es an der Tür.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Mann geht fluchend aufmachen.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Vor der Tür steht ein Kerl, offensichtlich angetrunken:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Freund, komm mit, ist gleich hier um die Ecke, du musst mich anschubsen.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Sag mal, Mann, spinnst du? Es ist drei Uhr nachts. Frag jemand anderen.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Mann legt sich wieder ins Bett.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Die Frau fragt, wer da war.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ach, irgendein Trottel hängt fest und wollte, dass ich ihn anschubse. Ich hab ihn zum Teufel geschickt.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"zhena","text":"Du bist echt ein Unmensch.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"zhena","text":"Weißt du noch, wie uns der Motor abgesoffen ist, mitten im Regen, und irgendein junger Kerl uns eine ganze Stunde angeschoben hat?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"zhena","text":"Kannst du einem Menschen nicht mal aushelfen?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Mann kriecht, wieder fluchend, aus dem Bett und zieht sich an.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Er geht hinaus in den Hof, stockdunkel. Er ruft:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Hey, Mann! Wo bist du?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Aus der Dunkelheit:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Hier bin ich! Komm her!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0,"offscreen":true},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Wo ist denn hier?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Na hier, auf der Schaukel!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0,"offscreen":true,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"spalnya","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"bed-1"},{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"bed-2"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"sleep"},{"type":"act","who":"zhena","act":"sleep"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"sit"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"door"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"}]},{"location":"gostinaya","place":"front-door","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","muzhik-ryzhy":"drunk"},"looks":{"muzhik-ryzhy":{"add":["red-nose"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"door"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"bottle","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","act":"wave"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"point"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"}]},{"location":"spalnya","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"door"},{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"bed-2"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"bed-1"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"lie"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"act","who":"zhena","act":"shrug"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"wave"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"act","who":"zhena","act":"point"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"act","who":"zhena","act":"shake-head"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"stand"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"door"},{"type":"line","ref":"l13"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","place":"park","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","muzhik-ryzhy":"drunk"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l14"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"wave"},{"type":"line","ref":"l15"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"turn"},{"type":"line","ref":"l16"},{"type":"line","ref":"l17"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"shrug"},{"type":"line","ref":"l18"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"facepalm"},{"type":"line","ref":"l19"}]}]}
{"id":"ru-095e7c23ed09.ru","jokeId":"ru-095e7c23ed09","locale":"ru","adaptation":"original","notes":"Source wording kept; the last narration split where the action changes, the professor's last speech split after «Ну ты и сволочь!». No corridor backdrop, so the university hall stands in for it: the two meet walking, the source's pause is a pause beat, they part off both edges; a week later (wipe) the green-faced professor walks in and grabs the student.","title":"Борода","location":"klass","cast":["paren","doktor"],"roles":{"paren":"student","doktor":"professor"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"По коридору ВУЗа идет профессор.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Навстречу студент:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"paren","text":"Здравствуйте, профессор. Можно Вас спросить?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"doktor","text":"Конечно, спрашивайте, молодой человек.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"paren","text":"Скажите, профессор, Вы когда спать ложитесь, бороду на одеяло или под одеяло кладете?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"После некоторой паузы:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"doktor","text":"Да, знаете, как-то не задумывался.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"paren","text":"Ну, извините, пожалуйста.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Разошлись.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Через неделю зеленый профессор с кругами под глазами","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"встречает в коридоре того же студента и хватает за грудки:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"doktor","text":"Ну ты и сволочь!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"doktor","text":"Неделю уже спать не могу — и так неудобно, и так неудобно!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"klass","place":"university","cast":["paren","doktor"],"roles":{"paren":"student","doktor":"professor"},"looks":{"doktor":{"add":["white-beard","glasses"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"doktor","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"paren","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"paren","act":"bow"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"nod"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"act","who":"paren","act":"point"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"pause","sec":1.2},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"scratch-head"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"shrug"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"act","who":"paren","act":"bow"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"off-left"},{"type":"move","who":"doktor","to":"off-right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"}]},{"location":"klass","place":"university","transition":"wipe","cast":["paren","doktor"],"roles":{"paren":"student","doktor":"professor"},"looks":{"doktor":{"add":["white-beard","glasses"],"skin":"#b9cf94"}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"doktor","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"grab"},{"type":"act","who":"paren","act":"hands-up"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"},{"type":"line","ref":"l13"}]}]}
{"id":"ru-095e7c23ed09.en","jokeId":"ru-095e7c23ed09","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line, «сволочь» as 'swine' to stay clean. Same staging as ru: they meet in the university hall (no corridor backdrop), pause beat, part; a week later the green-faced professor grabs the student.","title":"The Beard","location":"klass","cast":["paren","doktor"],"roles":{"paren":"student","doktor":"professor"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A professor is walking down a university corridor.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"A student comes the other way:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"paren","text":"Hello, professor. May I ask you something?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"doktor","text":"Of course, ask away, young man.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"paren","text":"Tell me, professor, when you go to bed, do you put your beard over the blanket or under the blanket?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"After a little pause:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"doktor","text":"Well, you know, I've never really thought about it.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"paren","text":"Well, sorry to bother you.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"They went their separate ways.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"A week later the professor, green in the face, with circles under his eyes,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"runs into the same student in the corridor and grabs him by the collar:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"doktor","text":"Why, you swine!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"doktor","text":"I haven't slept for a week — it's uncomfortable this way, and it's uncomfortable that way!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"klass","place":"university","cast":["paren","doktor"],"roles":{"paren":"student","doktor":"professor"},"looks":{"doktor":{"add":["white-beard","glasses"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"doktor","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"paren","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"paren","act":"bow"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"nod"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"act","who":"paren","act":"point"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"pause","sec":1.2},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"scratch-head"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"shrug"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"act","who":"paren","act":"bow"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"off-left"},{"type":"move","who":"doktor","to":"off-right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"}]},{"location":"klass","place":"university","transition":"wipe","cast":["paren","doktor"],"roles":{"paren":"student","doktor":"professor"},"looks":{"doktor":{"add":["white-beard","glasses"],"skin":"#b9cf94"}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"doktor","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"grab"},{"type":"act","who":"paren","act":"hands-up"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"},{"type":"line","ref":"l13"}]}]}
{"id":"ru-095e7c23ed09.de","jokeId":"ru-095e7c23ed09","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line, formal 'Sie' from the student, the professor's outburst switches to 'du' as in the source. Same staging as ru.","title":"Der Bart","location":"klass","cast":["paren","doktor"],"roles":{"paren":"student","doktor":"professor"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Durch den Flur der Uni geht ein Professor.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Ihm entgegen kommt ein Student:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"paren","text":"Guten Tag, Herr Professor. Darf ich Sie etwas fragen?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"doktor","text":"Natürlich, fragen Sie nur, junger Mann.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"paren","text":"Sagen Sie, Herr Professor, wenn Sie schlafen gehen, legen Sie den Bart auf die Decke oder unter die Decke?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Nach einer gewissen Pause:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"doktor","text":"Wissen Sie, darüber habe ich nie nachgedacht.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"paren","text":"Na, dann entschuldigen Sie bitte.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Sie gingen auseinander.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Eine Woche später begegnet der Professor, ganz grün im Gesicht und mit Ringen unter den Augen,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"im Flur demselben Studenten und packt ihn am Kragen:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"doktor","text":"Du Mistkerl!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"doktor","text":"Seit einer Woche kann ich nicht schlafen — so ist es unbequem, und so ist es unbequem!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"klass","place":"university","cast":["paren","doktor"],"roles":{"paren":"student","doktor":"professor"},"looks":{"doktor":{"add":["white-beard","glasses"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"doktor","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"paren","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"paren","act":"bow"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"nod"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"act","who":"paren","act":"point"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"pause","sec":1.2},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"scratch-head"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"shrug"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"act","who":"paren","act":"bow"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"off-left"},{"type":"move","who":"doktor","to":"off-right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"}]},{"location":"klass","place":"university","transition":"wipe","cast":["paren","doktor"],"roles":{"paren":"student","doktor":"professor"},"looks":{"doktor":{"add":["white-beard","glasses"],"skin":"#b9cf94"}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"doktor","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"grab"},{"type":"act","who":"paren","act":"hands-up"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"},{"type":"line","ref":"l13"}]}]}
{"id":"ru-19a7da93045c.ru","jokeId":"ru-19a7da93045c","locale":"ru","adaptation":"original","notes":"Source wording kept; the first narration split where the action changes, the prayer split in two. Inside the car (driver seat, light shake while driving, nervous shiver, looking around, praying hands), then cut to the street where his car drives in and parks on the miracle line; he points to the sky and waves God off from the window.","title":"Парковка","location":"doroga","cast":["muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Мужик едет на встречу, опаздывает, нервничает,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"не может найти место припарковаться.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Поднимает лицо к небу и говорит:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Господи, помоги мне найти место для парковки.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Я тогда брошу пить и буду каждое воскресенье ходить в церковь!","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Вдруг чудесным образом появляется свободное местечко.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Мужик снова обращается к небу:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"А, всё, не надо. Нашёл!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"doroga","place":"car","cast":["muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["tie"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"driver"},{"type":"shake","sec":2,"strength":"light"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"shiver"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"turn"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"pray-hands"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["tie"]}},"vehicles":[{"id":"car","kind":"car","riders":["muzhik"]}],"beats":[{"type":"drive","vehicle":"car","from":"off-left","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"point"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"wave"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"}]}]}
{"id":"ru-19a7da93045c.en","jokeId":"ru-19a7da93045c","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line. Same staging as ru: inside the car praying, then the street where his car pulls into the spot and he waves God off from the window.","title":"Parking","location":"doroga","cast":["muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A man is driving to a meeting, he's late, he's nervous,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"and he can't find anywhere to park.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"He lifts his face to the sky and says:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Lord, help me find a parking space.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Then I'll quit drinking and go to church every Sunday!","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Suddenly, miraculously, a free spot appears.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The man turns to the sky again:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Oh, never mind. Found one!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"doroga","place":"car","cast":["muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["tie"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"driver"},{"type":"shake","sec":2,"strength":"light"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"shiver"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"turn"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"pray-hands"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["tie"]}},"vehicles":[{"id":"car","kind":"car","riders":["muzhik"]}],"beats":[{"type":"drive","vehicle":"car","from":"off-left","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"point"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"wave"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"}]}]}
{"id":"ru-19a7da93045c.de","jokeId":"ru-19a7da93045c","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line. Same staging as ru: inside the car praying, then the street where his car pulls into the spot and he waves God off from the window.","title":"Der Parkplatz","location":"doroga","cast":["muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Ein Mann fährt zu einem Termin, ist spät dran, ist nervös,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"und findet keinen Parkplatz.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Er hebt das Gesicht zum Himmel und sagt:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Herr, hilf mir, einen Parkplatz zu finden.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Dann hör ich auf zu trinken und gehe jeden Sonntag in die Kirche!","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Plötzlich wird wie durch ein Wunder eine Lücke frei.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Mann wendet sich wieder an den Himmel:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ach, schon gut, nicht nötig. Hab einen gefunden!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"doroga","place":"car","cast":["muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["tie"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"driver"},{"type":"shake","sec":2,"strength":"light"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"shiver"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"turn"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"pray-hands"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["tie"]}},"vehicles":[{"id":"car","kind":"car","riders":["muzhik"]}],"beats":[{"type":"drive","vehicle":"car","from":"off-left","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"point"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"wave"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"}]}]}
